{title: Jana Gana Mana}
{artist: Rabindranath Tagore National Anthem}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] Jana gana mana,        adhi [Am] naayaka [F] jaya he
[C] Bhaarata [G] bhaagya,        vi [C] dhaata
Pun [C] jaab Sindhu Gujarat Maratha,        [F] Draavida Utkala [C] Banga
[Am] Vindhya Himaachala,        [G] Yamuna [F] Ganga
[C] Uchhala [G] Jaladhi ta [C] ranga,        [C] Tava shubha naame [F] jaage,
[G] tava shubha aashish [C] maange,        [Am] Gaaye [G] tava jaya [F] gaatha
[C] Jana gana mangala [G] daayaka jaya he,        [F] Bhaarata bhaagya vi [C] dhaata
Jaya [Am] he, jaya [G] he, jaya [F] he,        [C] jaya jaya [Am] jaya jaya [F] he
